er-specified paths under a directory. If the application is running on Windows, and the requested path ends with a special device name, the file will be opened successfully, but reading will hang indefinitely. This issue has been fixed in version 3.1.6.\",\"cvss\":[{\"source\":\"nvd@nist.gov\",\"type\":\"Primary\",\"version\":\"3.1\",\"vector\":\"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:L\",\"metrics\":{\"baseScore\":5.3,\"exploitabilityScore\":3.9,\"impactScore\":1.5},\"vendorMetadata\":{}},{\"source\":\"security-advisories@github.com\",\"type\":\"Secondary\",\"version\":\"4.0\",\"vector\":\"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X\",\"metrics\":{\"baseScore\":6.3},\"vendorMetadata\":{}}],\"epss\":[{\"cve\":\"CVE-2026-27199\",\"epss\":0.00556,\"percentile\":0.44127,\"date\":\"2026-08-30\"}],\"cwes\":[{\"cve\":\"CVE-2026-27199\",\"cwe\":\"CWE-67\",\"source\":\"security-advisories@github.com\",\"type\":\"Secondary\"}]}],\"matchDetails\":[{\"type\":\"exact-direct-match\",\"matcher\":\"python-matcher\",\"searchedBy\":{\"language\":\"python\",\"namespace\":\"github:language:python\",\"package\":{\"name\":\"werkzeug\",\"version\":\"3.1.5\"}},\"found\":{\"vulnerabilityID\":\"GHSA-29vq-49wr-vm6x\",\"versionConstraint\":\"<3.1.6 (python)\"},\"fix\":{\"suggestedVersion\":\"3.1.6\"}}],\"artifact\":{\"id\":\"pkg:pypi/werkzeug@3.1.5?package-id=d3b1c299370ad85d\",\"name\":\"werkzeug\",\"version\":\"3.1.5\",\"type\":\"python\",\"locations\":[{\"path\":\"/requirements.txt\",\"accessPath\":\"\"}],\"language\":\"python\",\"licenses\":[],\"cpes\":[\"cpe:2.3:a:python-werkzeug:python-werkzeug:3.1.5:*:*:*:*:*:*:*\",\"cpe:2.3:a:python-werkzeug:python_werkzeug:3.1.5:*:*:*:*:*:*:*\",\"cpe:2.3:a:python_werkzeug:python-werkzeug:3.1.5:*:*:*:*:*:*:*\",\"cpe:2.3:a:python_werkzeug:python_werkzeug:3.1.5:*:*:*:*:*:*:*\",\"cpe:2.3:a:python-werkzeug:werkzeug:3.1.5:*