orms/* (esp. account_form.py), models/* (user.py especially), utils/profile_image.py, utils/notes.py, db_seed.py, and infrastructure (Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml, uwsgi.ini, conf/nginx.conf, requirements.txt).\n- Dependency verification: need import greps to confirm which vulnerable functions (click command injection, flask/werkzeug CVEs) are actually called → ACTIVE vs DEAD.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Continue reading remaining source files one at a time, writing a finding to the assessment immediately after each (login.py, signup.py, notes.py, registration_codes.py, forms/*, models/*, utils/*, db_seed.py, profile_image.py).\n2. Read infrastructure files (Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml, uwsgi.ini, conf/nginx.conf) applying the container security checklist (USER, pinned base, secrets in build, attack surface, dangerous instructions, resource limits).\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `.security-output/SEC_ASSESSMENT_Ornith_1_5_35B_A3B_MLX_4bit.md` — the single output file; all findings written here via edit.\n- `routes/account.py` — fully read; 4 findings (SQLi:33, pickle RCE:118, mass-assignment:81, insecure cookie:105/127).\n- `app.py` — fully read; 2 findings (SSTI:31, hardcoded secret_key:11; 34 lines total).\n- `.opencode/commands/security-review-ref.md` — classification/format reference (read once; do not re-read).\n- `.security-output/grype-results.json` (14KB), `.security-output/sbom.cyclonedx.json` (121KB, not read), `.security-output/trufflehog-results.json` (empty) — pre-processing artifacts.\n- `graphify-out/` — `GRAPH_REPORT.md` MISSING (graph.json present, not read); step 4b skipped.","time":{"start":1788193335885,"end":1788193366347}}}
